<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says in big Malaysia deals.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says in big Malaysia deals.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunicatons group AB LM Ericsson said on Wednesday it had won several big orders from Cellular Communications Network Sdn Bhd (Celcom) of Malaysia to expand its GSM and ETACS networks.</p>
<p>Ericsson said in a statement that over the last 18 months, Celcom had chosen Ericsson for orders totalling over 940 million crowns. It said 600 million crowns of this had been signed in the last months of 1996.</p>
</text>
